PROVIDER llamacpp
ALIAS    qwen3.8-27b
# 128K is the most that leaves a margin on a 32 GiB machine (GPU limit about
# 29 GiB): about 21 GB of weights plus about 4.5 GB of q8 KV cache. llama.cpp
# multiplies CONTEXT by PARALLEL, so raising PARALLEL needs a smaller CONTEXT.
# See README.md for the arithmetic.
CONTEXT  128K
PARALLEL 1
PRESET   ./preset.ini
BASEURL  http://127.0.0.1:8081/v1
